      "credit": "Own work",
      "description": "Shopping in the supermarket with multicultural result - Italian Pizza (German made, frozen), Arabic Halva (super sweet), Asian instant noodle snacks, Swiss Emmental cheese, international-style energy drink \"Booster\", Italian-style coffee (well, almost...) as Nespresso-system capsules from local Munich company Dallmayr. And YES, I do buy and eat vegetables and fruit and stuff regularly, but not today ;-) Interestingly, to add to the multicultural character of this image, in the left upper corner is an advertisement of a dentist (\"Zahnarzt\") Dr. Yakin. Yakin is a family name which is used both in the Turkish and Jewish culture - but which of both options applies here can of course not be told from the advertisement.",
